          "line2": "<span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-2vw\">External fixation system allows for a variety of joint bridging and non-bridging frames with simple modular components. The modularity of the system allows the surgeon to adapt the frame to soft tissue complications and fracture pattern.</span></span>",
