      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-65eab19e7c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-65eab19e7c@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Sep 23 2022 22:05:06 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">A. System Approach to MRI</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n All components in the system are designed for safety in the MRI environment. Patented light-weight and advanced composite materials are non-ferromagnetic and non-conductive.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">B. Modular</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n Full System modularity allows the surgeon to build the frame to suit soft tissue and fracture requirements</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">C. Easy to Use</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n Patented “Snap-Fit” technology makes stable frame building simple. Reduce the fracture, make post-operative adjustments, and treat soft tissue damage with the frame in situ.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">D. Independent Pin Placement</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n With Independent Pin Placement, the surgeon may easily build a frame to treat fractures close to a joint, capture fracture fragments, or to stay clear of damaged soft-tissue areas.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n</span><span class=\"futura-bold\">E. Compatibility</span><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><br>\n The Hoffmann II Compact MRI 5mm/8mm Rod to Rod Coupling is used to connect the Hoffmann II Compact MRI 5mm Rods to a Hoffmann II 8mm Rod. This may be helpful in a Foot/Ankle Frame or to connect a humerus frame to a radius frame. The coupling is tightened with a 7mm Wrench.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Sat Oct 15 2022 22:46:34 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
